              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵaŵilasile ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Nafutali, Asha, ni mbali syosope siŵili sya Manase, nipo ŵatopwesye Amidiyani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidiyoni ŵatumisye ŵamitenga ku cilambo cosope ca kwitumbi ca Efelemu kuti akajile, “Ayice atuluce ŵapute Amidiyani. Ŵawugalile Lusulo lwa Yolodani ni sulo sine syosope mpaka ku Beti Bala, kuti Amidiyani akasajomboka.” Acalume ŵa lukosyo lwa Efelemu ŵaŵilasile pamo, ni ŵawugele Lusulo lwa Yolodani ni sulo sine mpaka ku Beti Bala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵakamwile ayimwene ŵaŵili ŵa Amidiyani, Olebu ni Seebu, ŵamwuleje Olebu pa Lwala lwa Olebu, nipo Seebu pa malo gakuminyila finyo ga Seebu. Jemanjajo ŵapitilisye kwatoposya Amidiyani ni ŵayice najo mitwe ja Olebu ni Seebu kwa Gidiyoni, juŵaliji kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Yolodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.25"
            ]
          }
